<Item XName="PlotPattern1" UserName="PlotPattern1" Type="Equation">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>NumOfAntx=4;&#x000D;&#x000A;NumOfAnty=4;&#x000D;&#x000A;Dx = 0.5; %wavelength&#x000D;&#x000A;Dy = 0.5; %wavelength&#x000D;&#x000A;Resolution = pi/180;&#x000D;&#x000A;TWOPI = 2*pi;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;[LocationX, LocationY] = meshgrid( (0:NumOfAntx-1)*Dx, (0:NumOfAnty-1)*Dy );&#x000D;&#x000A;LocationZ = zeros( NumOfAnty, NumOfAntx );&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;theta = [0 : Resolution : pi/2];&#x000D;&#x000A;phi = [0 : Resolution : TWOPI];&#x000D;&#x000A;[THETA,PHI]=meshgrid(theta,phi);&#x000D;&#x000A;AF_Tx = zeros(size(THETA)); %antenna factor&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;using(&apos;System1_Design1_Data&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;%assuming the max one is the desired channel voltage at the Tx output&#x000D;&#x000A;weights=[max(V2), max(V3), max(V4), max(V5), max(V6), max(V7), max(V8), max(V9), max(V10), max(V11), max(V12), max(V13), max(V14), max(V15), max(V16), max(V17)];&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;numElements = numel(weights);&#x000D;&#x000A;for k = 1 : numElements&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;AF_Tx = AF_Tx + weights(k) * exp(j * TWOPI * ( LocationX(k) * sin(THETA) .* cos(PHI) + LocationY(k) * sin(THETA) .* sin(PHI) + LocationZ(k) * cos(THETA) ));&#x000D;&#x000A;end&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;deltaSolidAngle = zeros(size(THETA)); %delta solid angle&#x000D;&#x000A;[numRows, numCols] = size(deltaSolidAngle);&#x000D;&#x000A;for k = 2 : numCols&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;deltaSolidAngle(:,k) = Resolution * (cos(THETA(:,k-1)) - cos(THETA(:,k)));&#x000D;&#x000A;end&#x000D;&#x000A;integral = sum(sum((abs(AF_Tx).^2) .* deltaSolidAngle));&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;AG_Tx = (abs(AF_Tx).^2) * 4 * pi / integral; % antenna gain w.r.t isotropic assume each element is isotropic&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;azimuth = PHI;&#x000D;&#x000A;zenith = THETA;&#x000D;&#x000A;magnitude = max(10*log10(AG_Tx),-30); %dBi with minimum level -30dB&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;graph1=graph_figure(&apos;BeamPattern1_Spectrasys&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;graph1.add_spherical_data( azimuth, zenith, magnitude );</Text>
