<Item XName="PostProcessing" UserName="PostProcessing" Type="Equation">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>% because Spectrasys doesn&apos;t do array functions, and Phased Array analysis&#x000D;&#x000A;% does not compute all the Spectrasys measurements, some manual post-processing&#x000D;&#x000A;% is necessary to get apples-to-apples results. For example, if you analyze &#x000D;&#x000A;% one path and get NF=15dB, then 16 paths in parallel should result in &#x000D;&#x000A;% NF = 15dB - 10*log10(16) = 3dB.&#x000D;&#x000A;%&#x000D;&#x000A;using(&apos;PhasedArray2_Design2_Data&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;numElements = length(NodeInfo_ElemList)-1;&#x000D;&#x000A;pathIndep = NodeInfo_ElemList(1:numElements);&#x000D;&#x000A;DCP_Path1_PhasedArray = zeros(5,1);&#x000D;&#x000A;GAIN_Path1_PhasedArray = zeros(5,1);&#x000D;&#x000A;for k=1:numElements&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;signalPowerVector = getvariable(&apos;PhasedArray2_Design2_Data&apos;,[&apos;NodeInfo_Signal_Power_&apos;, pathIndep{k}, &apos;_Output&apos;]);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;DCP_Path1_PhasedArray(k) = signalPowerVector(1);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;if k==1&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009; &#x0009;GAIN_Path1_PhasedArray(k) = 1;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;else&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;&#x0009;GAIN_Path1_PhasedArray(k) = DCP_Path1_PhasedArray(k) / DCP_Path1_PhasedArray(k-1);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;end&#x000D;&#x000A;end&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;setdisplayunit(&apos;DCP_Path1_PhasedArray&apos;, &apos;dBm&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;setindep(&apos;DCP_Path1_PhasedArray&apos;, &apos;pathIndep&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;setdisplayunit(&apos;GAIN_Path1_PhasedArray&apos;, &apos;dB&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;setindep(&apos;GAIN_Path1_PhasedArray&apos;, &apos;pathIndep&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;using(&apos;System2_Design2_Data_Path1&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;CNF_PhasedArrayDesign = CNF;&#x000D;&#x000A;EOIP3_PhasedArrayDesign = EOIP3;&#x000D;&#x000A;setindep(&apos;CNF_PhasedArrayDesign&apos;, &apos;pathIndep&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;setindep(&apos;EOIP3_PhasedArrayDesign&apos;, &apos;pathIndep&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;using(&apos;System1_Design1_Data_Path1&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;DCP_SystemAnalysis = DCP;&#x000D;&#x000A;GAIN_SystemAnalysis = GAIN;&#x000D;&#x000A;CNF_SystemDesign = CNF;&#x000D;&#x000A;EOIP3_SystemDesign = EOIP3;&#x000D;&#x000A;setindep(&apos;DCP_SystemAnalysis&apos;, &apos;pathIndep&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;setindep(&apos;GAIN_SystemAnalysis&apos;, &apos;pathIndep&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;setindep(&apos;CNF_SystemDesign&apos;, &apos;pathIndep&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;setindep(&apos;EOIP3_SystemDesign&apos;, &apos;pathIndep&apos;);</Text>
